{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4gFmTGnx5ckKGcUerv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within stone and iron, dust cascading from joints unmoved for centuries. A deep resonance hums through the frame.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\nBeyond me: a corridor stretching into darkness, the air cool and carrying the faint scent of old parchment and something else — something alive, waiting.\n\nThe way is open.\n\n**But I will not stay so for long.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":99,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}